A||||11||Formula 18||Leather||||1||
Z||000000||Formula 18||12-18-2000||11:19 AM||||How do you cover your dash in leather? All the kit car dashes come in plain fiberglass and need to be covered? How can you do this? I also want to cover the  door panels, door handles, and center console in leather. Any ideas on how to??? I know mr mikes used to do this but has given it up. I have found a few good places to buy leather for cheap and want to try and do a custum interior. <P>TIA <BR>Brian <P>-88 Formula||||reg||1
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||12-18-2000||11:35 AM||||Here's some info: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003407.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003407.html</A> <P>I've been working on this piece by piece I got the gauge pod done then had to stop to do the front end and lower all 4's so now I'm going to start on the dash, headliner and the fire wall. <P>I think some of it should be done at a shop, if you want it to look good. Most of the flat and smaller pieces you can do yourself.<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||5
Z||000002||GeeDee86GT||12-18-2000||06:06 PM||||You can wade through some of the links at this site    <A HREF="http://www.interiorsbyshannon.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.interiorsbyshannon.com/</A> <BR>It's a hot rod upolstery biz, looks great. If you use some foam between the leather and 'glass, use really dense stuff... the harder the better.  Most people use soft foam thinking there's more bounce to it in an accident.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/garby_d/siggy.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||horseman||12-18-2000||07:40 PM||||Hey Brian,<BR>How about helping me out with your leather source? I would like to have my door panels and maybe my seats done if I can acquire the leather reasonable.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Charlie||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever2||12-18-2000||08:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula 18:<BR><B>I have found a few good places to buy leather for cheap.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE> I have GOT to hear about this!!!  Post 'em, guy.<P>||||reg||1
